{"id":"c10899c45464ad7f","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-classifier-meet-implication.md","title":"Definition — Meet and Implication on the Subobject Classifier","display":"Definition — Meet and Implication on the Subobject Classifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-classifier-meet-implication","aliases":["14-df-classifier-meet-implication"],"display":"Definition — Meet and Implication on the Subobject Classifier","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-classifier-meet-implication"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-classifier-meet-implication</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Meet and Implication on the Subobject Classifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,t:1\\to\\Omega)\">\\((\\Omega,t:1\\to\\Omega)\\)</span> 是选定分类子；固定积。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_m\">\\(\\chi_m\\)</span> 为单态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的唯一特征箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1:\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\pi_1:\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 为第一投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示唯一描述；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,e\">\\(L,e\\)</span> 在公式中量化而非预选。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\chi_{\\langle t,t\\rangle}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\wedge_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\chi_{\\langle t,t\\rangle}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega\\times\\Omega,\\Omega)\\ \\exists L,e\\ (\\mathrm{IsEqualizer}_{\\mathcal E}(L,e,\\wedge_\\Omega,\\pi_1)\\land h=\\chi_e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega\\times\\Omega,\\Omega)\\ \\exists L,e\\ (\\mathrm{IsEqualizer}_{\\mathcal E}(L,e,\\wedge_\\Omega,\\pi_1)\\land h=\\chi_e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega\\times\\Omega,\\Omega)\\ \\exists L,e\\ (\\mathrm{IsEqualizer}_{\\mathcal E}(L,e,\\wedge_\\Omega,\\pi_1)\\land h=\\chi_e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Rightarrow_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega\\times\\Omega,\\Omega)\\ \\exists L,e\\ (\\mathrm{IsEqualizer}_{\\mathcal E}(L,e,\\wedge_\\Omega,\\pi_1)\\land h=\\chi_e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.7–I.8；IV.8。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t,t\\rangle:1\\to\\Omega\\times\\Omega\">\\(\\langle t,t\\rangle:1\\to\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\)</span> 为单态射，分类它给交真值箭头。对任意广义真值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q:X\\to\\Omega\">\\(p,q:X\\to\\Omega\\)</span>，其复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_\\Omega\\langle p,q\\rangle\">\\(\\wedge_\\Omega\\langle p,q\\rangle\\)</span> 分类两子对象之交。等化子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\wedge q=p\">\\(p\\wedge q=p\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leq q\">\\(p\\leq q\\)</span>；它的特征箭头给蕴涵。等化子的同构选择不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_e\">\\(\\chi_e\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,t:1\\to\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1:\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"L,e","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\chi_{\\langle t,t\\rangle}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega\\times\\Omega,\\Omega)\\ \\exists L,e\\ (\\mathrm{IsEqualizer}_{\\mathcal E}(L,e,\\wedge_\\Omega,\\pi_1)\\land h=\\chi_e).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega\\times\\Omega,\\Omega)\\ \\exists L,e\\ (\\mathrm{IsEqualizer}_{\\mathcal E}(L,e,\\wedge_\\Omega,\\pi_1)\\land h=\\chi_e).","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle t,t\\rangle:1\\to\\Omega\\times\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"p,q:X\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_\\Omega\\langle p,q\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"p\\wedge q=p","display":false},{"tex":"p\\leq q","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_e","display":false}],"bytes":1657,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-classifier-meet-implication|Definition — Meet and Implication on the Subobject Classifier]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]]"},{"id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\wedge$ 特指 [[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]] 定义的 $\\wedge_\\Omega$；$j\\times j$ 是 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]] 的积箭头，$1$ 是选定终对象。"},{"id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$、有限积及指数。$m:U\\hookrightarrow1$ 是单态射，$u=\\chi_m:1\\to\\Omega$。$[m]$ 是其子对象类，$\\chi_A$ 是子对象 $A$ 的特征箭头；$\\Rightarrow_\\Omega$ 见 [[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]]。$U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}$ 是以下新构造，$X$ 遍历 $\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]]"},{"id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书定位：IV.8，印刷页 198–203。良定义性：交由单态射拉回给出，底由始对象到 $X$ 的箭头之像给出，并由两个代表的余积到 $X$ 的箭头之像给出（像存在见 [[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]）。蕴涵是 [[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]] 的 $\\Rightarrow_\\Omega$ 与 $\\langle\\chi_A,\\chi_B\\rangle$ 的复合所分类的子对象：$D$ 限制到其中恰好表示 $D\\wedge A\\leq B$。反对称性保证四种唯一描述均单值。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-classifier-meet-implication|Definition — Meet and Implication on the Subobject Classifier]]"},{"id":"3ac28cc449b6cd1f","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\mathcal C}$ 的分类子在本条选为下列 $(\\Omega,t_\\Omega)$；LT 谓词所用的真值交是它由 [[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]] 确定的典范交运算。$1^{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}$ 为下列单元素预层，$*$ 是 $\\varnothing$ 的别名。"},{"id":"f255d6c7945bca41","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"abee8603b9a8b54a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","1044b7940aaa4f1f","199dc3cf97e92fa1"]}